From a0d248d171776d288137a01b59a7ee577855c2b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:10:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 220/220] mailbox: mediatek: describe and test disabled MT6897
 tinysys transport

Add the mailbox binding and build support, disabled stock-address SCMI mailbox and SRAM nodes, and extracted-production MMIO, SiP, IRQ and resource error tests. Leave the generic SCMI transport unchanged and include no vendor protocol or policy client.
